    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d614">

                <pb facs="0551" n="541" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg541"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/9–2849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-28T16:00:00+08:00">September 28,
                            1949—4 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 28—8:01 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1631. ReContel 1576, September 20.<anchor n="91" xml:id="d614-f1"/> Chinese
                    informant stated September 20 that new government to be established October 1.
                    This fits in with other reports date has been stepped up, but without
                    confirmation. Note, however, mass celebration being organized, for October 2 <pb
                        facs="0552" n="542" xml:id="pg542"/> for International Peace Day and “Birth
                    People’s Republic of China”.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 1631, Department pass Shanghai 1018.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
